<title>UK: UK meals/feeds end with soybean meal lower again.</title>
<headline>UK meals/feeds end with soybean meal lower again.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>At the close of the UK meals and feeds market, soybean meal selling levels were once again down due to currency factors, traders said.</p>
<p>No trade was reported but traders said that early Chicago soybean meal futures trading pointed to further losses likely when trading resumes on Thursday.</p>
<p>Rapemeal and sunflower pellets and meal values were left unchanged.</p>
<p>--Stephen Grainger +44 171 542 8074.</p>
